## 3. Endpoints（CRM 集成相关）

```
POST   /crm-integration                          # 新建集成
GET    /crm-integration/list?platform=&status=   # 集成列表
POST   /crm-integration/{id}                     # 更新
POST   /crm-integration/{id}/toggle              # ACTIVE / DISABLED
POST   /crm-integration/{id}/sync?force=0|1      # ⭐ 手动触发（EXT-24 行为变更）
GET    /crm-integration/sync-log/list?integrationId=  # 同步日志
GET    /crm-integration/dashboard                # 看板
```

